abstract: >
  This repository contains the working manuscript and analysis scaffold for the Satellite Laser Ranging (SLR) study in the Temporal Equivalence Principle (TEP) research program.

  The initial release establishes a clean project identity, citation metadata, and a reproducible manuscript site build pipeline. The scientific content and SLR-specific analyses will be added iteratively as the study proceeds.
